  "description": "SkySense is a large-scale multi-modal remote sensing foundation model (MM-RSFM) with 2.06 billion parameters, pre-trained on 21.5 million temporal sequences from optical and SAR data. It features a factorized multi-modal spatiotemporal encoder, multi-granularity contrastive learning, and geo-context prototype learning for universal Earth Observation imagery interpretation.",
